{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"186725867":{"pageid":186725867,"ns":6,"title":"File:2025-10-08 CCJ - Comiss\u00e3o de Constitui\u00e7\u00e3o, Justi\u00e7a e Cidadania (54841482494).jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":1438758,"width":3240,"height":2160,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg/960px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":640,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg/1920px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg/960px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":960,"height":640,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg/1920px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482494%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o,_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_(54841482494).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=186725867","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>Comiss\u00e3o de Constitui\u00e7\u00e3o, Justi\u00e7a e Cidadania (CCJ) realiza reuni\u00e3o deliberativa com 7 itens. Entre eles, o PL 1.473/2025, que altera o Estatuto da Crian\u00e7a e do Adolescente (ECA) e o C\u00f3digo Penal para ampliar o tempo de interna\u00e7\u00e3o de menores infratores e permitir pris\u00e3o preventiva em at\u00e9 24 horas ap\u00f3s o flagrante. A pauta inclui ainda o PL 425/2024, que aumenta as penas para explora\u00e7\u00e3o sexual de menores, e a PEC 22/2025, que trata do descanso de motoristas profissionais. \n</p><p>Parlamentares exibem cartaz  \"Fim da escala 6x1\". \n</p><p>Pose:\ndeputada Erika Hilton (PSOL-SP);\ndeputada Daiana Santos (PCdoB-RS);\nsenador Paulo Paim (PT-RS);\nsenador Weverton (PDT-MA); \nsenador Rog\u00e9rio Carvalho (PT-SE).\n</p>\nFoto: Andressa Anholete/Ag\u00eancia Senado","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2025-10-08 12:53","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/49143546@N06\">Ag\u00eancia Senado</a> from Brasilia, Brazil","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"186725853":{"pageid":186725853,"ns":6,"title":"File:2025-10-08 CCJ - Comiss\u00e3o de Constitui\u00e7\u00e3o, Justi\u00e7a e Cidadania (54841482519).jpg","index":3,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":1165566,"width":3240,"height":2160,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg/960px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":640,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg/1920px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg/960px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":960,"height":640,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg/1920px-2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o%2C_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_%2854841482519%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2025-10-08_CCJ_-_Comiss%C3%A3o_de_Constitui%C3%A7%C3%A3o,_Justi%C3%A7a_e_Cidadania_(54841482519).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=186725853","extmetadata":{"ImageDescript